data: {"id": "647303dbe33b40e0-thinking-parallel_evidence-635", "run_id": "647303dbe33b40e0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的关键事实：\n\n1.  **当前状态**：Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器 `app` 处于 **`CrashLoopBackOff`** 状态，`ready=False`。\n2.  **终止原因**：容器最后一次终止的退出码为 **`137`** (OOMKilled)。`kubectl describe` 明确记录 Reason 为 `OOMKilled`。\n3.  **重启计数**：容器已重启 **11次**。`describe` 显示 BackOff 警告在过去 **40分钟** 内持续产生，表明异常已持续较长时间，未恢复。\n4.  **Prometheus 指标**：`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 确认重启计数与 k8s 状态一致；`kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 应显示 `OOMKilled`。\n\n**证据小结**：\n- **支持异常**：ContainerStatus 明确显示 CrashLoopBackOff，退出码 137，重启", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788800991652, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

